"role": "user", "content": "I received a tent as a gift 45 days ago (outside your 30-day window) but one of the poles was cracked in the box. I was traveling and could not report it sooner. Given your return and warranty policies, what can you actually do for me here?"}], "output_message": {"role": "assistant", "content": "I understand your frustration. While our standard 30-day return window has passed, defective items fall under our **warranty coverage**, which extends **one year from purchase**. A cracked pole qualifies as a manufacturing defect.\n\nHere's what we can do:\n\n**Next step:** Contact our support team with:\n- Your order number (or the gift receipt if available)\n- Photos of the cracked pole\n- Proof of purchase date\n\nWe'll likely replace the defective pole or the entire tent at no cost. The warranty supersedes the return deadline for defects.\n\n**Reply to this message or call us at [support number]** with those details, and we'll get this resolved quickly."}, "otel_gen_ai": {"gen_ai.system": "anthropic", "gen_ai.operation.name": "text_completion", "gen_ai.request.max_tokens": 300, "gen_ai.request.model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "gen_ai.request.temperature": 0.2, "gen_ai.response.model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "gen_ai.response.id": "chatcmpl-64871222-32d1-41b2-9c4b-91a2b4b61d44", "gen_ai.response.finish_reasons": ["stop"], "gen_ai.usage.input_tokens": 134, "gen_ai.usage.output_tokens": 154, "gen_ai.usage.cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "gen_ai.anthropic.cache_read_input_tokens": 0}, "framework": "litellm", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 134, "completion_tokens": 154, "total_tokens": 288, "cached_tokens": 0, "reasoning_tokens": 0}, "response_model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "response_id": "chatcmpl-64871222-32d1-41b2-9c4b-91a2b4b61d44", "finish_reason": "stop", "prompt_tokens": 134, "completion_tokens": 154, "total_tokens": 288}, "hash": "sha256:9b95e584f96e80e991a21a0d6bcb182887f8f944036d434230d3f5e37bdee0b3", "previous_hash": "sha256:4b63